<ProjectTemplate title="Split" link="https://split.mzhan.dev/">
  <p>
    A clone of Splitwise that I've used for vacations with my friends. It's not
    the prettiest (due to my significant lack of an eye for design) and it still
    has some bugs, but it works well as a very minimal expense tracker. It's a
    React frontend with a Go backend, using Postgres as a database. View source
    on <Link href="https://github.com/michaelzhan1/split" text="GitHub" />.
  </p>
